title AI-GUIDED VIRTUAL SCIENCE LAB SYSTEM

direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface rough

Client [label: "CLIENT", color: blue] {
  Mobile_App [label: "Mobile Application", icon: smartphone]
}

Backend [label: "BACKEND SERVICES", color: purple] {
  Session_Manager [label: "Lab Session & Experiment Management", icon: clipboard-list]
  Virtual_Lab [label: "Virtual Lab Simulation & Action Processing", icon: flask-conical]
  Student_Model [label: "AI Student Model & Misconception Detection", icon: brain-circuit]
  Guidance [label: "Adaptive Hint & Report Generation", icon: lightbulb]
}

Data [label: "KNOWLEDGE & DATA", color: green] {
  Knowledge_Base [label: "Experiment & Curriculum Knowledge Base", icon: book-open]
  Student_Database [label: "Student Action & Session Database", shape: cylinder, icon: database]
  Model_Parameters [label: "Trained Model Parameters", shape: cylinder, icon: sliders]
}

Training [label: "MODEL TRAINING", color: orange] {
  Model_Training [label: "Model Training & Validation", icon: cpu]
}

Mobile_App > Session_Manager: lab actions
Session_Manager > Virtual_Lab
Virtual_Lab > Student_Model
Student_Model > Guidance
Guidance > Mobile_App: adaptive hints & session report

Virtual_Lab > Student_Database: store actions & results
Student_Database > Student_Model: student action history
Knowledge_Base > Backend: curriculum & signatures
Model_Parameters --> Student_Model: trained parameters [color: orange]

Student_Database --> Model_Training: training data [color: orange]
Model_Training --> Model_Parameters: updated model [color: orange]
